      "type": "grammar",
      "title": "Measure words 本 and 件",
      "body": "In Chinese, a number or 这/那 needs a measure word before the noun. You already know 个, which works for many things. Use 本 for books and other bound things. Use 件 for a piece of clothing on the upper body, and for many single items. The pattern is: number (or 这/那) + measure word + noun.",
